260
00:40:18,060 --> 00:40:18,810
[SPEAKER_01] To je 111.

261
00:40:18,810 --> 00:40:22,500
[SPEAKER_00] I 111, a vi ćete imati u ovoj godini do kraja ove.

262
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:24,420
[SPEAKER_01] Do kraja ove godine. Računamo da ćemo.

263
00:40:24,420 --> 00:40:24,660
[SPEAKER_00] Biti.

264
00:40:24,900 --> 00:40:26,430
