267
00:40:34,140 --> 00:40:34,980
[SPEAKER_00] Mene, bez medija.

268
00:40:34,980 --> 00:40:35,670
[SPEAKER_01] Bez medija.

269
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:37,110
[SPEAKER_00] Odnosno uz napade medije.

270
00:40:37,290 --> 00:40:46,230
[SPEAKER_01] I s time da su oni za 111 tisuća dobili 130 milijuna kuna bespovratnih, a mi smo dobili ništa. E, onda onda to vidite i onda shvatite

